  "description": "<h1>Air Filter Only Drains In Raid</h1>\n<p>Are you tired of feeling bad about your air filters draining while you’re busy managing your inventory or doing stuff in your hideout? Well no more!</p>\n<p>With this mod the air filters in your hideout Air Filtering Unit will only drain while you’re actually in a PMC raid! (Not in Scav raids)</p>\n<p>This means the air filter timer in your hideout now shows how long you can spend inside raids before it runs out.</p>\n<h2>Balance</h2>\n<p>This mod doesn’t change how long an air filter lasts so if you want to balance it I recommend using SVM to set your air filter drain rate to somewhere around 1.5 to 2.</p>\n<h2>FIKA Compatibility</h2>\n<p>I made the mod to track in-raid status per session ID. Users of this mod have confirmed it works as intended with FIKA.</p>\n<h2>Known Issues</h2>\n<p>If you ALT+F4 or crash during a PMC raid your air filter will keep draining until you start your client again or stop the server. This is because there is no straightforward server-side way to track in-raid PMCs.</p>\n",
